# Support LLM Agent Task Catalog (Folder-Aware)

This app lives in three places:
- Frappe app: `crm-deployment/crm/`
- Frontend SPA: `frappe-bench/apps/crm/frontend/`
- Chatbot: `assistant/executive-ai-assistant-main/farfalle-main/`

## A. API Documentation & Collections
1) Generate Postman collection for CRM endpoints
   - Source files: `crm-deployment/crm/api/*.py`
   - Include: `crm.api.doc`, `crm.api.etl`, `crm.api.email`, `crm.api.agent`, `crm.api.settings`, `crm.api.session`
   - For each whitelisted method: method name, URL `/api/method/<dotted>`, example request/response
   - Output file: `crm-deployment/docs/crm_postman_collection.json`

2) Endpoint README
   - Create `crm-deployment/docs/CRM_API.md` with sections per module and curl examples

## B. ETL Fixtures & Tests
1) CSV fixtures
   - Path: `crm-deployment/scripts/fixtures/etl/`
   - Files:
     - `basic_leads.csv` (happy-path)
     - `missing_org.csv` (org name empty)
     - `odd_headers.csv` (non-standard headers to test autogenerate_mapping)
     - `huge_rows.csv` (1001 rows to test sync cap)

2) Sync import tests
   - Create `crm-deployment/tests/test_etl_sync.py`
   - Cases: imports basic, autogenerate mapping for odd headers, rejects >5k rows, captures additional_data

## C. Email Module Tests
1) Unit tests for `crm-deployment/crm/api/email.py`
   - File: `crm-deployment/tests/test_email.py`
   - Tests: save_draft (returns Communication), send (sets Sent), link_provider_ids

## D. Frontend Help & UX
1) Leads Upload modal tooltips
   - File: `frappe-bench/apps/crm/frontend/src/components/Modals/LeadsUploadModal.vue`
   - Add brief tooltips for file selection, mapping profile, sync mode

2) README for upload page
   - File: `crm-deployment/docs/UPLOAD_LEADS.md`
   - Steps with screenshots (paths), common errors (status/source), sync explanation

## E. Farfalle Tool Adapters (HTTP)
1) Create adapters folder
   - Path: `assistant/executive-ai-assistant-main/farfalle-main/adapters/crm/`
   - Files:
     - `client.py` (session, CSRF management, retry)
     - `tools.py` (list_docs, get_doc, insert_doc, set_value, email_draft/send, import_rows/job_status)

2) JSON schema validation
   - Path: `assistant/.../farfalle-main/schemas/crm/`
   - Schemas for each tool input/output; validate before call

## F. Security & RBAC Aids
1) RBAC matrix
   - File: `crm-deployment/docs/RBAC_TOOLS.md`
   - Table mapping roles → allowed tool calls (read/write)

2) Audit log template
   - File: `assistant/.../farfalle-main/docs/AUDIT_LOGGING.md`
   - Fields: time, user, tool, doctype, args hash, result, latency

## G. Observability Specs
1) Logging format guideline
   - File: `crm-deployment/docs/LOGGING.md`
   - Structured keys, examples for ETL and email

2) Grafana dashboard spec
   - File: `assistant/.../farfalle-main/docs/GRAFANA.md`
   - Panels: tool latency p50/p95, error rate, cost per query

## H. CSV Mapping Profiles
1) Profiles folder
   - Path: `crm-deployment/scripts/fixtures/mappings/`
   - Files: `hubspot_leads.json`, `apollo_leads.json`
   - Fields mapping and transforms list

## Conventions
- Provide diffs for each code edit; do not change business logic
- Include run commands for tests (pytest) and example curls